OL,3,GNEWSARare early ride-on mower to go
OL,4,Aunder the hammer
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the first ride-on mowers sold in
OL,7,Fthe UK has been found in an industrial
OL,8,Funit in Lincoln and is being sold at
OL,9,Fauction later this week.
OL,11,FIndustrial auctioneers BTG Eddisons
OL,12,Fsaid the Anzani Lawnrider, introduced
OL,13,Fin the early 1960s on the UK domestic
OL,14,Fmarket, had no brakes and had to be
OL,15,Fleant into corners like a motorbike.
OL,17,FThe mower retailed at about #100 and
OL,18,Fauctioneer Paul Cooper said: "It didn't
OL,19,Fsell in big numbers," and surviving
OL,20,Fmodels were "rare".
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
