OL,3,GNEWSARare early ride-on mower to go
OL,4,Aunder the hammer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe machine will go under the hammer at
OL,7,FBTG Eddisons auction centre in
OL,8,FScunthorpe on Tuesday at 13:00 BST.
